<title>THAILAND: GSS Array says 1996 net tumbles.</title>
<headline>GSS Array says 1996 net tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending November 24, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.74	 vs	 10.25</p>
<p>    Net			 99.46	 vs	215.35</p>
<p>Notes: Fourth quarter figures not stated. Company's full name is GSS Array Technology Plc and is an electronic parts producer.</p>
